// Money (WP7.4, docs/rules/economy.md, "Money"): the storage scenario's playfield, field and rock
// patch, with credits. The store is the money pool: the ore a refinery takes goes in as credits and
// the structures the player builds are paid out of it, tick by tick, while they go up.
//
// `unit_defs` names the FROZEN copy of WP7.2 (harvest_defs); the ore, harvest, storage and money
// numbers are written out below, so editing the shipped ore.ron, harvest.ron, unit_defs.ron or
// money.ron never moves this checksum. Kinds: 0 construction_center (build radius 8), 1 power_plant
// (2 x 3, 300 credits, 300 ticks), 2 refinery, 3 barracks (2 x 3, 400 credits, 400 ticks, needs a
// power plant), 11 harvester.
//
//   slot 0  the construction centre of player 0 on (84, 74), complete from the first tick
//   slot 1  the refinery of player 0 on (96, 86): capacity 600
//   slot 2, 3  harvesters of player 0 on (104, 90) and (106, 92), tick 0
//   tick 1     a power plant on (90, 74) and another on (90, 78): 1 credit per tick each; player 0
//              starts with 300 credits, so the plants run for 150 ticks together and then wait
//              for the first load of ore
//   tick 4650  a barracks on (84, 80): 1 credit per tick, while the store is full (600) and a
//              harvester waits in the bay with its load; the payments make room and the load goes in
//
// What happens (tools/sf_headless/tests/money.rs asserts it): the credits drain 2 a tick to zero,
// the plants stop (build_left does not move) while there are none, they go on in bursts as the
// harvesters unload (2.5 credits a tick while a load goes in), both are complete, harvesting
// fills the store to 600, a harvester waits, and the barracks opens the room. CI runs the scenario
// on Linux and Windows and requires the checksum in money.expected.
Scenario(
    name: "money",
    seed: 0x0007_0074,
    map: (width: 256, height: 256),
    map_name: Some("playfield256"),
    unit_defs: Some("harvest_defs"),
    buildings: true,
    factions: [(0, Meridian), (1, Veyran)],
    ore: Some((start: 120, max: 160, regrow_amount: 1, regrow_period: 200)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
        travel_cost: 16,
        queue_cost: 100,
        switch_margin: 100,
        recheck_period: 20,
        queue_gap: 3,
        queue_start: 1,
        queue_step: 2,
        queue_rows: 8,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 600)]),
    money: Some((credits_per_ore: 1, starting: [(0, 300)])),
    ticks: 5400,
    commands: [
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 0, owner: 0, cell: (84, 74))),
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 2, owner: 0, cell: (96, 86))),
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 0, cell: (104, 90))),
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 0, cell: (106, 92))),
        (tick: 1, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (90, 74))),
        (tick: 1, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (90, 78))),
        (tick: 4650, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 3, cell: (84, 80))),
    ],
)
